 &gt;
 Notes
 &lt;i class="fas fa-fw fa-external-link-alt" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✅ Overview: cooperative cancellation; the 90% case; the cancellation
contract; exceptions to the &amp;ldquo;90% case&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✅ Requesting Cancellation: &lt;code&gt;CancellationTokenSource&lt;/code&gt;; timeouts; manual
cancellation; cancelling and disposing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✅ Detecting Cancellation: responding to cancellation;
&lt;code&gt;TaskCanceledException&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;OperationCanceledException.CancellationToken&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✅ Polling: how to poll; how not to poll; when to poll&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✅ Registration: how to register; a race condition; cleanup is important;
synchronous cancellation callbacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✅ Linking: linked cancellation tokens; use cases; don&amp;rsquo;t use
&lt;code&gt;OperationCanceledException.CancellationToken&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
